[61.105317, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(0.969315ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[61.105714, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.806149ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.534432ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(1.467571ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.235711ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.258436ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[61.106054, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(1.005251ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.130061ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
