[101.189702, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.667666ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.956032ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.372175ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
